<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφῡσ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow in different directions, disperse,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ . . ὁ ἄνεμος αὐτὴν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ψυχὴν</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> διαφυσᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					77d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				8c
			</span></i>d, <i><span class="en">
				84b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>blow</i> or <i>breathe through,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				68
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ στόματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.950c
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>inflate, fill with air,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Steril.</u>
					228
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.605
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
